        "content": "## Error Handler (bonus R7, R8)\nError Trigger -> Format Alert -> Telegram. Receives failures of the *Reject Article* workflow (and, if selected there, of the main workflow). The rejected article's title and text are inside `execution.error.message`, because the Error Trigger does not carry item data.\n\nSetup: connect the Telegram credential, set the chat id, then select this workflow as Error workflow in Settings of the other two. Error workflows run only for production (non-manual) executions.",
